# Day 45 – RAG Reranking with Spring AI + Jina AI

## 🚀 100 Days of AI Engineering

Day 45 focuses on improving the retrieval quality of a RAG system using **Reranking**.

Instead of directly sending the top vector-search results to the LLM, we first retrieve a larger set of candidates from PGVector and then use **Jina AI Reranker** to reorder them based on their relevance to the user's question.

This project is an **upgrade of the Day 44 RAG Observability project**.

---

## 🎯 Objective

Improve RAG answer quality by adding a **reranking layer** between vector retrieval and the LLM.

### Previous Day 44 Flow

```text
User Question
      ↓
PGVector Similarity Search
      ↓
Top Documents
      ↓
Qwen LLM
      ↓
Answer
